Setup to build an old release:

1. Move old-blend-configs/<release>.<blend-name>.blend and <release>.config
and corresponding release directory up one level and remove the release name
from the two filenames.

For example, daedalus.devuan-desktop-live.blend and daedalus.config
become devuan-desktop-live.blend and config.

2. Change the symlink live-sdk/extra/syslinux to point to the corresponding
syslinux directory for the release you want to build.

3. You may need to make some edits in your local copy of libdevuansdk/zlibs or
copy some functions from zlibs to your blend file.

For example, the excalibur blend file has conf_print_sourceslist() and
bootstrap_complete_base() to avoid making edits in the shared libraries.

